# npm's content-addressed cache. A handful of these blobs were committed by
# accident; `npm ci --cache .npm-cache` grows the directory to ~58 MB. It is
# pure machine-local build residue — never part of the source tree.
.npm-cache/

# NOTE: the ignore above is `/dist/` — anchored to the repository root — on
# purpose. `.baseline/dist/` IS committed: it is the verbatim pre-upgrade
# build that every performance claim is measured against, and that
# `npm run measure:baseline` and CI compare the current build to.
# ~550 kB of text, and deleting it would make the claims unfalsifiable.
